{
  "loctablePath" : "\/System\/Library\/PrivateFrameworks\/AXSpringBoardServerInstance.framework\/Accessibility-hello.loctable",
  "bundlePath" : "\/System\/Library\/PrivateFrameworks\/AXSpringBoardServerInstance.framework",
  "framework" : "AXSpringBoardServerInstance.framework",
  "localizations" : {
    "devices.have.ast.customActions" : [
      {
        "target" : "The custom actions on your pointing device will no longer work if AssistiveTouch is turned off. Do you want to continue?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "en"
      },
      {
        "target" : "AssistiveTouchがオフの場合、ポインティングデバイスのカスタムアクションは機能しなくなります。続けてもよろしいですか?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "ja"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Jeśli wyłączysz AssistiveTouch, wykonywanie czynności własnych przy użyciu urządzenia wskazującego nie będzie możliwe. Czy chcesz kontynuować?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "pl"
      },
      {
        "target" : "De anpassade åtgärderna på pekenheten kommer inte längre att fungera om AssistiveTouch stängs av. Vill du fortsätta?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "sv"
      },
      {
        "target" : "A mutatóeszköze egyéni műveletei nem fognak tovább működni, ha az AssistiveTouch ki van kapcsolva. Szeretné folytatni?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "hu"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Prilagođeni postupci na vašem uređaju za pokazivanje više neće raditi ako isključite AssistiveTouch. Želite li nastaviti?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "hr"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Если выключить AssistiveTouch, действия, настроенные для Вашего указательного устройства, перестанут работать. Продолжить?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "ru"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Les actions personnalisées appliquées à votre pointeur ne fonctionneront plus une fois AssistiveTouch désactivé. Voulez-vous continuer ?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "fr"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Tindakan tersuai pada peranti penuding anda tidak lagi akan berfungsi jika AssistiveTouch dinyahaktifkan. Adakah anda mahu teruskan?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "ms"
      },
      {
        "target" : "如關閉「輔助觸控」，指標裝置上的自訂動作將無法操作。你要繼續嗎？",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "zh_HK"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Vlastní akce nebudou na vašem ukazovacím zařízení k dispozici, pokud je AssistiveTouch vypnutý. Chcete pokračovat?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "cs"
      },
      {
        "target" : "AssistiveTouch를 끄면 포인팅 장치의 사용자 설정 동작이 더 이상 작동하지 않습니다. 계속하겠습니까?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "ko"
      },
      {
        "target" : "De specielle handlinger på dit pegeredskab virker ikke længere, hvis AssistiveTouch bliver slået fra. Vil du fortsætte?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "da"
      },
      {
        "target" : "AssistiveTouch kapatılırsa işaret aygıtınızdaki özel eylemler çalışmaz. Sürdürmek istiyor musunuz?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "tr"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Власні дії на вашому вказівному пристрої більше не працюватимуть, якщо вимкнено AssistiveTouch. Ви хочете продовжити?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "uk"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Специалните настройки на насочващото устройство няма повече да работят, ако изключите AssistiveTouch. Искате ли да продължите?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "bg"
      },
      {
        "target" : "The custom actions on your pointing device will no longer work if AssistiveTouch is turned off. Do you want to continue?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "en_GB"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Osoitinlaitteesi muokatut toiminnot eivät enää toimi, jos AssistiveTouch laitetaan pois päältä. Jatketaanko?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "fi"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Las acciones personalizadas en tu dispositivo apuntador dejarán de funcionar si se desactiva AssistiveTouch. ¿Quieres continuar?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "es_419"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Các tác vụ tùy chỉnh trên thiết bị trỏ của bạn sẽ không hoạt động nữa nếu AssistiveTouch bị tắt. Bạn có muốn tiếp tục không?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "vi"
      },
      {
        "target" : "As ações personalizadas do dispositivo indicador não funcionarão mais se o AssistiveTouch for desligado. Deseja continuar?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "pt"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Las acciones personalizadas del dispositivo señalador dejarán de funcionar cuando desactives AssistiveTouch. ¿Quieres continuar?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "es"
      },
      {
        "target" : "As ações personalizadas aplicadas ao cursor deixarão de funcionar se o AssistiveTouch for desativado. Gostaria de continuar?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "pt_PT"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Po vypnutí AssistiveTouch prestanú fungovať vlastné akcie polohovacieho zariadenia. Chcete pokračovať?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "sk"
      },
      {
        "target" : "如果关闭辅助触控，那么你指针设备上的自定操作将无法继续工作。要继续吗？",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "zh_CN"
      },
      {
        "target" : "การทำงานที่กำหนดเองบนอุปกรณ์ตัวชี้ของคุณจะไม่ทำงานอีกต่อไปหาก AssistiveTouch ถูกปิด คุณต้องการดำเนินการต่อหรือไม่",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "th"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Οι προσαρμοσμένες ενέργειες στη συσκευή κατάδειξης δεν θα λειτουργούν αν απενεργοποιήσετε το AssistiveTouch. Θέλετε να συνεχίσετε;",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "el"
      },
      {
        "target" : "यदि AssistiveTouch बंद हो, तो आप जिस डिवाइस पर पॉइंट कर रहे हैं, उस पर अब कस्टम क्रियाएँ काम नहीं करेंगी। क्या आप जारी रखना चाहते हैं?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "hi"
      },
      {
        "target" : "若關閉「輔助觸控」，你的指向裝置上的自訂動作將無法運作。你要繼續嗎？",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "zh_TW"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Wird AssistiveTouch ausgeschaltet, werden die eigenen Aktionen auf deinem Zeigegerät nicht mehr funktionieren. Möchtest du fortfahren?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "de"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Se AssistiveTouch è disattivato, le azioni personalizzate smetteranno di funzionare. Vuoi continuare?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "it"
      },
      {
        "target" : "The custom actions on your pointing device will no longer work if AssistiveTouch is turned off. Do you want to continue?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "en_AU"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Tindakan khusus di perangkat penunjuk Anda tidak akan lagi dapat digunakan jika AssistiveTouch dimatikan. Apakah Anda ingin melanjutkan?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "id"
      },
      {
        "target" : "لن تعمل الإجراءات المخصصة على جهاز الإشارة إذا كان اللمس المساعد متوقف. هل ترغب في المتابعة؟",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "ar"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Les actions personnalisées de votre appareil de pointage ne fonctionneront plus si AssistiveTouch est désactivé. Souhaitez-vous continuer?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "fr_CA"
      },
      {
        "target" : "AssistiveTouch функциясы өшірілген жағдайда, көрсеткіш құрылғыдағы арнаулы әрекеттер жұмыс істемейтін болады. Жалғастыру қажет пе?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "kk"
      },
      {
        "target" : "De aangepaste taken op je aanwijsapparaat werken niet meer als AssistiveTouch is uitgeschakeld. Wil je doorgaan?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "nl"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Les accions personalitzades del dispositiu assenyalador deixaran de funcionar si es desactiva l’AssistiveTouch. Vols continuar?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "ca"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Acțiunile personalizate de pe dispozitivul de indicare nu vor mai funcționa dacă funcționalitatea AssistiveTouch este dezactivată. Doriți să continuați?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "ro"
      },
      {
        "target" : "De tilpassede handlingene på pekeenheten din vil ikke virke hvis AssistiveTouch er slått av. Vil du fortsette?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "no"
      },
      {
        "target" : "הפעולות המותאמות אישית במכשיר ההצבעה שלך יפסיקו לעבוד אם AssistiveTouch יכובה. האם להמשיך?",
        "filename" : "Accessibility-hello.loctable",
        "language" : "he"
      }
